eof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-f11bb278a0f13d95END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-4ddd5f2e4910b114END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_MurderTribunal_TribunalMasonsJournal</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_MurderTribunal_TribunalMasonsJournal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_MurderTribunal_TribunalMasonsJournal\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">6c48a766-c553-40f8-ba94-1f7db9a0debc</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:6c48a766-c553-40f8-ba94-1f7db9a0debc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:6c48a766-c553-40f8-ba94-1f7db9a0debc\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a <a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Chest\" title=\"Wooden Chest\">Wooden Chest</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Murder_Tribunal\" title=\"Murder Tribunal\">Murder Tribunal</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1258&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;521</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Never in all the years of my craft have I felt I was carving my own tomb. This armoured husk I once thought a man... He has trapped me here during the renovations. While he says I'm free to leave after the work is done... <a href=\"/wiki/Ilmater\" title=\"Ilmater\">Ilmater</a>, this Godsawful smell. I'm no fool.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714205919\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1405/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24367/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5905/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931348/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.651      1 -total\n 97.98%   42.769      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n 45.85%   20.015      6 Template:Icon_text\n 40.89%   17.848     15 Template:Trim\n 22.08%    9.638      2 Template:Uid\n 15.61%    6.812      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.20%    5.764      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.04%    4.384      1 Template:Books\n  9.44%    4.119      1 Template:Icon_link\n  9.34%    4.077      6 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:46825-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714205919 and revision id 329558. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}